# {{skill_name}} INIT

Verify access to the reactive runtime.

1. Check reactive capabilities when the MCP tool is available.
2. Otherwise check reactive-skills-axi capabilities --json, then the zero-install AXI launcher.
3. Select one compatible runtime and retain it for this job.
4. Emit RUNTIME_READY when runtime access works.
5. Emit SETUP_REQUIRED when no compatible runtime works.
